          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Where ಪಟ್ಟಿ (paṭṭi), \"a list\", comes from is not settled. DEDR 3877 lists Kannada paṭṭe, paṭṭi, \"a stripe\", as native, and Sanskrit has paṭṭikā, \"a slab, a tablet\" (CDIAL 7699); a list is a strip of writing, and either could have given the sense."
            }
          ]
        },
